  "instructions": "1. Press out the liquid in 1 packet firm tofu.\n2. Slice and marinate tofu overnight in low sodium soy sauce.\n3. Bake tofu at 350 for 20-30 mins.\n4. Pickled veggies: marinate carrot, radish and cucumber in rice vinegar with a little date sugar.\n5. Toast a slice of Ezekiel 4:9 bread. Spread Cashew Cheese mixed with Sriracha Sauce. Add baked tofu slices and pickled veggies. Optionally add jalape\u00f1os too.",
